! Exam 06:
! Dr. Alkan's migratory insertion with a manually truncated variant
! of the Sapporo-TZP-2012 basis set.
! An all-electron Palladium atom.
! We are only interested in the first iteration energy to test
! the correctness of the two-electron integrals
!
